  "stem": "A note was under the books. They covered most of it. What do They and it refer to?",
  "options": [
    "They=books; it=note",
    "They=note; it=books",
    "They=books; it=table",
    "They=notes; it=book"
  ],
  "answerIndex": 0,
  "optionRationales": [
    {
      "optionIndex": 0,
      "isCorrect": true,
      "reason": "They=books; it=note：They 承接複數 books，it 承接單數 note，且書能蓋住紙條。"
    },
    {
      "optionIndex": 1,
      "isCorrect": false,
